# Build/release artifacts materialized into this package for NPM packaging:
# network/, project.json, and blazegraph-image.json are copied from the repo root at build/pack time
# (see the `build` and `prepack` scripts in package.json); build-info.json is
# generated by `release:build-info`. Kept out of source control so builds don't
# dirty the worktree and so the repo-root copies stay the single source of truth.
network/
project.json
blazegraph-image.json
blazegraph-namespace-contract.cjs
build-info.json
